abstract: >-
  Experimental data and analysis code for measuring the energy impact
  of prompt compression in LLM inference. Includes Phase 2 direct GPU
  power measurements (600 trials) demonstrating the Output Length Paradox:
  prompt compression reduces tokens by 17% but saves only 4.9% energy.
